@@ -0,0 +1,33 @@
+## Why
+
+The school wants to reward customers who stay longer. Rentals of 3 days or more should cost less than the
+sum of their daily prices.
+
+## What Changes
+
+- A rental period of 3 or more days gets a 10% discount on its full price (daily price × days).
+- The reduced total is what `quote` returns and what `book` records and returns, so both always agree.
+- Rentals of 1 or 2 days are unchanged.
+- The discount is rounded to whole euro cents (half up), so totals stay integers.
+
+**Scope**: rental pricing in quotes and bookings (lessons are not part of this module).
+**Out of scope**: showing the discount as a separate line, other tiers, discounts for lessons, season
+enforcement (April to October is still not enforced here), and the cancellation policy.
+
+No runtime dependency is introduced.
+
+## Capabilities
+
+### New Capabilities
+
+None.
+
+### Modified Capabilities
+
+- `equipment-rental`: the Quote and Booking requirements change, because the total is now discounted for
+  rentals of 3 days or more.
+
+## Impact
+
+- `src/index.ts`: the shared pricing step used by `quote` and `book`.
+- `test/rental.test.ts`: new tests for the boundary and rounding.
